WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.872
Wukong landed on another mountain peak.

2
00:00:04.873 --> 00:00:09.806
“Ah-choo!” The monkey groaned.

3
00:00:09.807 --> 00:00:12.885
“That fire and smoke were awful!

4
00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:19.340
And the sand went right in—ah-ah-choo!—my nose.”

5
00:00:19.341 --> 00:00:22.419
He looked at the Demon of Power’s mountain.

6
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.466
The fire and smoke were now gone.

7
00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:29.485
Wukong was about to return to that mountain.

8
00:00:29.486 --> 00:00:32.101
But then he hesitated. “The

9
00:00:32.102 --> 00:00:36.151
demon will just use the same trick again,” thought the monkey. “I’ll

10
00:00:36.152 --> 00:00:38.802
sneak into his cave and look around. Maybe

11
00:00:38.803 --> 00:00:44.304
I can find out how he created the fire, smoke, and sand.” Wukong

12
00:00:44.305 --> 00:00:53.678
turned into a bug and flew back to the demon’s mountain. He

13
00:00:53.679 --> 00:01:00.315
went into the cave and flew down a long, dark tunnel. He

14
00:01:00.316 --> 00:01:07.840
soon found a brightly lit bedroom filled with nice furniture and fancy decorations. In

15
00:01:07.841 --> 00:01:11.546
a corner a woman sat in a chair. She

16
00:01:11.547 --> 00:01:13.907
was crying. Poof!

17
00:01:13.908 --> 00:01:17.722
Wukong turned back into himself. “Oh!”

18
00:01:17.723 --> 00:01:21.902
cried the woman. “Wh-who are you?” “My name

19
00:01:21.903 --> 00:01:25.280
is Sun Wukong,” said the monkey. “Are you

20
00:01:25.281 --> 00:01:27.026
the queen?” The woman

21
00:01:27.027 --> 00:01:29.143
nodded. “Your husband

22
00:01:29.144 --> 00:01:33.118
sent me to rescue you,” said Wukong. The queen’s

23
00:01:33.119 --> 00:01:36.400
face broke into a smile. “Oh, please

24
00:01:36.401 --> 00:01:37.879
do! The demon

25
00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:43.347
who kidnapped me is horrible—nasty, ugly, smelly!” The queen

26
00:01:43.348 --> 00:01:45.232
shivered. “He said

27
00:01:45.233 --> 00:01:49.848
he loves me and wants to... m-marry me!” The queen started to cry

28
00:01:49.849 --> 00:01:52.769
again. “Don’t worry, Your Majesty,” said

29
00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:55.734
Wukong. “I’ll defeat the demon. But

30
00:01:55.735 --> 00:01:57.424
first I must figure

31
00:01:57.425 --> 00:02:02.210
out how he creates the fire, smoke, and sand.” “That’s simple.” The queen sniffed.

32
00:02:02.211 --> 00:02:05.379
“He has three bells. The

33
00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:07.246
first bell makes fire. The

34
00:02:07.247 --> 00:02:09.506
second bell makes smoke. And

35
00:02:09.507 --> 00:02:11.721
