36
00:02:11.722 --> 00:02:14.978
“I saw the bells,” said Wukong.

37
00:02:14.979 --> 00:02:17.781
“He wears them around his neck.”

38
00:02:17.782 --> 00:02:19.688
The monkey smiled. “You wait here,

39
00:02:19.689 --> 00:02:21.215
Your Majesty. Tonight

40
00:02:21.216 --> 00:02:23.062
I’ll steal those bells from

41
00:02:23.063 --> 00:02:25.916
the demon. Once I defeat him, I’ll come

42
00:02:25.917 --> 00:02:29.739
back and rescue you.” The monkey turned back into a

43
00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:37.531
bug and flew down another tunnel. Soon he found a second bedroom.

44
00:02:37.532 --> 00:02:41.402
This one was dark and gloomy.

45
00:02:41.403 --> 00:02:44.611
“This must be the demon’s bedroom,”

46
00:02:44.612 --> 00:02:48.348
thought Wukong. “I’ll wait here until the demon

47
00:02:48.349 --> 00:02:53.078
goes to sleep.” He landed on the ceiling and waited.

48
00:02:53.079 --> 00:02:56.948
A little while later, the Demon of

49
