“I’m tired.” The demon climbed into bed and closed

52
00:03:13.484 --> 00:03:17.780
his eyes. Soon he was snoring loudly. Wukong turned

53
00:03:17.781 --> 00:03:21.035
back into himself. He plucked

54
00:03:21.036 --> 00:03:24.155
a few of his hairs

55
00:03:24.156 --> 00:03:30.073
and turned them into fleas. The fleas landed on the demon’s neck

56
00:03:30.074 --> 00:03:34.168
and began biting. The demon scratched at his neck and

57
00:03:34.169 --> 00:03:37.666
rolled over. Then he scratched some more— and more.

58
00:03:37.667 --> 00:03:41.120
Finally the demon sat up. “Why

59
00:03:41.121 --> 00:03:43.533
is my neck so itchy?” he

60
00:03:43.534 --> 00:03:47.914
said. “Maybe it’s these bells. I’ll take them

61
00:03:47.915 --> 00:03:49.927
