62
00:03:49.928 --> 00:03:52.820
The demon laid the three bells on

63
00:03:52.821 --> 00:03:56.338
a table. A few minutes later he was snoring

64
00:03:56.339 --> 00:03:59.816
again. The fleas turned back into hairs and

65
00:03:59.817 --> 00:04:04.461
returned to Wukong. Next the monkey turned the hairs into

66
00:04:04.462 --> 00:04:09.603
three fake bells. He put them on the table and

67
00:04:09.604 --> 00:04:14.367
stuck the real bells in his robe. He looked at the sleeping demon. “It’s

68
00:04:14.368 --> 00:04:16.913
too dangerous to use these bells

69
00:04:16.914 --> 00:04:21.473
inside,” thought the monkey. “I’ll get the demon to come outside,

70
00:04:21.474 --> 00:04:26.497
and then I’ll fight him.” Wukong became invisible and ran back through the

71
00:04:26.498 --> 00:04:31.949
tunnel. A guard was sleeping next to the cave

72
00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:36.230
entrance. Wukong sneaked past him. Once he was outside,

73
00:04:36.231 --> 00:04:42.338
the monkey shouted. “Return

74
00:04:42.339 --> 00:04:46.329
the queen right now! If you don’t,

75
00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.887
I’ll smash your entire mountain!”

76
